    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d947">

                <pb facs="0887" n="783" xml:id="pg783"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/6879.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires at Buenos Aires to the
                        Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 26, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am informed by the Minister for Foreign Affairs that Argentina will probably
                    not recognize the Government of Mexico before that Government is recognized by
                    the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lorillard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
